{"summary":"The open world action RPG where you ruin everything.","description":"As you ascend from your shelter after the long long years, a brave new old world awaits you. A world inhabited with nasty and vile creatures. A world with no other human soul to be seen. A world with nature in reigns now. A world that's about to get even worse. You need to find a way to escape the wretched island. But before that, enjoy the bittersweet apocalypse.\n\nFeatures:\n* Break over 99% of all objects for materials with the right tools. No barrier will stop you.\n* Fight with (or run away) nasty and vile creatures of the post-apocalyptic era.\n* Explore the handcrafted open world and uncover its mysteries.\n* Survive. Clear areas of monsters and claim it as yours.\n* Build outposts to establish your presence.\n* Craft permanent weapons, tools, outfits, and trinkets.\n* Hunt various game or tame them for your post-apocalyptic zoo ranch.\n* Farm nutritious plants and reap the rewards as the crop gets ripe.\n* Solve puzzles above ground and underground in the Tombs of the Old Ones\n* Fish cunning scaly things under the watery surface.\n* Cook delicious recipes for permanent stat and ability upgrades.\n* Unravel the mysteries of the strange island.","esrbNotes":"Blood, Violence","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":"$4.49 - $4.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DqZD5lS9zl4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dXT1hAFFXyAkkWIdSIO3TJSqjjXjHuNYSA9f_VjK9vM8ZqQqL6D4YvfJq55pM3KO-oDYGnNaHMGrEs-bAmls5g","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TTkW3ehR7fG2ReL76fTdNpKyr1yE_Zb5yV6iR5bYmz5JpNrBUttsbg-9t7ik4p_wj-9RtwlGheKJfuztxrbU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EzXhFk6qzrEhkOwxPnC0kor305DmvA84UA_o3KLdq5CCDZBrKN78LSOQFJ7xfGz_-FAXdU_ErNUNz3v0eeGCRA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OUXH9-FtDWOM12hRQeCduHby7uk2A3G3lAwzcconkzZb-S-4qlIfhJqrhhSWe0eSf7Db3CK3ZEvCByQYUFnoEw","https://play-lh.googleuserco